{"seq":4,"slug":"release-engineering","title":"发布工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-architecture/large-scale-practices/release-engineering","wordCount":587,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"发布工程\">发布工程</h1><p>发布工程（Release Engineering）涵盖从代码提交到 App Store 上架的全流程。本文介绍版本策略、CI/CD 流水线、TestFlight 分发以及 App Store 提交自动化。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>发布工程把「代码提交」到「用户可见」之间的每一步流程化，围绕几个概念展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>版本策略</strong>：语义化版本与构建号各自承担不同的标识职责</li>\n<li><strong>CI/CD 流水线</strong>：从构建、测试到分发的自动化链</li>\n<li><strong>TestFlight 分发</strong>：面向测试者的灰度分发通道</li>\n<li><strong>提交自动化</strong>：用 Fastlane 等工具自动完成 App Store 提交流程</li>\n</ul>\n<p>其中<strong>版本策略</strong>是基础：版本号表达对用户的兼容语义，构建号则用于唯一标识每一次构建，二者配合让发布可追溯。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"版本策略\">版本策略</h2><p>iOS 应用使用语义化版本和构建号的组合：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    Version[&quot;版本号 1.2.3&quot;] --&gt; Major[&quot;主版本 1&quot;]&#10;    Version --&gt; Minor[&quot;次版本 2&quot;]&#10;    Version --&gt; Patch[&quot;补丁版本 3&quot;]&#10;    Build[&quot;构建号 456&quot;] --&gt; CI[&quot;CI 自增&quot;]&#10;&#10;    classDef ver fill:none,stroke:#2196F3&#10;    classDef build fill:none,stroke:#FF9800&#10;&#10;    class Version,Major,Minor,Patch ver&#10;    class Build,CI build\">graph LR\n    Version[\"版本号 1.2.3\"] --&gt; Major[\"主版本 1\"]\n    Version --&gt; Minor[\"次版本 2\"]\n    Version --&gt; Patch[\"补丁版本 3\"]\n    Build[\"构建号 456\"] --&gt; CI[\"CI 自增\"]\n\n    classDef ver fill:none,stroke:#2196F3\n    classDef build fill:none,stroke:#FF9800\n\n    class Version,Major,Minor,Patch ver\n    class Build,CI build</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>递增时机</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Major</td>\n<td>主版本，不兼容的重大变更</td>\n<td>重大改版、架构升级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Minor</td>\n<td>次版本，向后兼容的新功能</td>\n<td>新功能上线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Patch</td>\n<td>补丁版本，Bug 修复</td>\n<td>热修复发版</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Build Number</td>\n<td>构建号，每次构建递增</td>\n<td>每次 CI 构建</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>版本号自动化管理：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// 通过 agvtool 或 Fastlane 管理版本号&#10;// agvtool new-marketing-version 1.2.3&#10;// agvtool new-version -all 456&#10;&#10;// Fastlane 版本管理&#10;// increment_version_number(version_number: &quot;1.2.3&quot;)&#10;// increment_build_number(build_number: ENV[&quot;CI_BUILD_NUMBER&quot;])\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 通过 agvtool 或 Fastlane 管理版本号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// agvtool new-marketing-version 1.2.3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// agvtool new-version -all 456</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Fastlane 版本管理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// increment_version_number(version_number: \"1.2.3\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// increment_build_number(build_number: ENV[\"CI_BUILD_NUMBER\"])</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"ci-cd-流水线\">CI/CD 流水线</h2><p>完整的 iOS CI/CD 流水线：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Push[&quot;代码推送&quot;] --&gt; Lint[&quot;代码规范检查&quot;]&#10;    Lint --&gt; Build[&quot;编译&quot;]&#10;    Build --&gt; Test[&quot;单元测试 + UI 测试&quot;]&#10;    Test --&gt; Snapshot[&quot;快照测试&quot;]&#10;    Snapshot --&gt; Analysis[&quot;静态分析&quot;]&#10;    Analysis --&gt; Decision{&quot;目标分支?&quot;}&#10;    Decision --&gt;|develop| TestFlight[&quot;TestFlight 内测&quot;]&#10;    Decision --&gt;|release| AppStore[&quot;App Store 提交&quot;]&#10;    Decision --&gt;|feature| PR[&quot;PR 检查完成&quot;]&#10;&#10;    classDef ci fill:none,stroke:#2196F3&#10;    classDef decision fill:none,stroke:#FF9800&#10;    classDef deploy fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50&#10;&#10;    class Push,Lint,Build,Test,Snapshot,Analysis ci&#10;    class Decision decision&#10;    class TestFlight,AppStore,PR deploy\">graph TD\n    Push[\"代码推送\"] --&gt; Lint[\"代码规范检查\"]\n    Lint --&gt; Build[\"编译\"]\n    Build --&gt; Test[\"单元测试 + UI 测试\"]\n    Test --&gt; Snapshot[\"快照测试\"]\n    Snapshot --&gt; Analysis[\"静态分析\"]\n    Analysis --&gt; Decision{\"目标分支?\"}\n    Decision --&gt;|develop| TestFlight[\"TestFlight 内测\"]\n    Decision --&gt;|release| AppStore[\"App Store 提交\"]\n    Decision --&gt;|feature| PR[\"PR 检查完成\"]\n\n    classDef ci fill:none,stroke:#2196F3\n    classDef decision fill:none,stroke:#FF9800\n    classDef deploy fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50\n\n    class Push,Lint,Build,Test,Snapshot,Analysis ci\n    class Decision decision\n    class TestFlight,AppStore,PR deploy</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"fastlane-配置\">Fastlane 配置</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// Fastfile&#10;default_platform(:ios)&#10;&#10;platform :ios do&#10;    desc &quot;运行所有测试&quot;&#10;    lane :test do&#10;        scan(&#10;            scheme: &quot;MyApp&quot;,&#10;            clean: true,&#10;            code_coverage: true,&#10;            output_types: &quot;html,junit&quot;,&#10;            result_bundle: true&#10;        )&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    desc &quot;构建并上传到 TestFlight&quot;&#10;    lane :beta do&#10;        ensure_git_status_clean&#10;        increment_build_number(build_number: ENV[&quot;CI_BUILD_NUMBER&quot;])&#10;&#10;        build_app(&#10;            scheme: &quot;MyApp&quot;,&#10;            export_method: &quot;app-store&quot;,&#10;            output_directory: &quot;./build&quot;,&#10;            xcargs: &quot;-allowProvisioningUpdates&quot;&#10;        )&#10;&#10;        upload_to_testflight(&#10;            skip_waiting_for_build_processing: true,&#10;            apple_id: ENV[&quot;APPLE_ID&quot;],&#10;            team_id: ENV[&quot;TEAM_ID&quot;]&#10;        )&#10;&#10;        slack(&#10;            message: &quot;新版本已上传到 TestFlight 🚀&quot;,&#10;            channel: &quot;#ios-releases&quot;&#10;        )&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    desc &quot;提交到 App Store&quot;&#10;    lane :release do&#10;        ensure_git_branch(branch: &quot;release/*&quot;)&#10;&#10;        build_app(&#10;            scheme: &quot;MyApp&quot;,&#10;            export_method: &quot;app-store&quot;,&#10;            include_bitcode: false&#10;        )&#10;&#10;        upload_to_app_store(&#10;            submit_for_review: true,&#10;            automatic_release: false,&#10;            force: true,&#10;            precheck_include_in_app_purchases: false,&#10;            submission_information: {&#10;                add_id_info_uses_idfa: false&#10;            }&#10;        )&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    desc &quot;代码签名管理&quot;&#10;    lane :sync_certificates do&#10;        match(&#10;            type: &quot;appstore&quot;,&#10;            app_identifier: &quot;com.example.myapp&quot;,&#10;            readonly: true&#10;        )&#10;&#10;        match(&#10;            type: &quot;development&quot;,&#10;            app_identifier: &quot;com.example.myapp&quot;,&#10;            readonly: true&#10;        )&#10;    end&#10;end\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Fastfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">default_platform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ios)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">platform </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ios </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    desc </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"运行所有测试\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    lane </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">test </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        scan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            scheme</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MyApp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            clean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            code_coverage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            output_types</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"html,junit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            result_bundle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    desc </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"构建并上传到 TestFlight\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    lane </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">beta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ensure_git_status_clean</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        increment_build_number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">build_number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: ENV[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CI_BUILD_NUMBER\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        build_app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            scheme</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MyApp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#