"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//   skip_binary_upload: true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// )</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"发布流程时间线\">发布流程时间线</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    T1[&quot;代码冻结&quot;] --&gt; T2[&quot;RC 构建&quot;]&#10;    T2 --&gt; T3[&quot;QA 回归&quot;]&#10;    T3 --&gt; T4[&quot;修复阻塞 Bug&quot;]&#10;    T4 --&gt; T5[&quot;TestFlight RC&quot;]&#10;    T5 --&gt; T6[&quot;App Store 提交&quot;]&#10;    T6 --&gt; T7[&quot;审核等待(1-3天)&quot;]&#10;    T7 --&gt; T8[&quot;发布上线&quot;]&#10;&#10;    classDef dev fill:none,stroke:#2196F3&#10;    classDef qa fill:none,stroke:#FF9800&#10;    classDef release fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50&#10;&#10;    class T1,T2 dev&#10;    class T3,T4,T5 qa&#10;    class T6,T7,T8 release\">graph LR\n    T1[\"代码冻结\"] --&gt; T2[\"RC 构建\"]\n    T2 --&gt; T3[\"QA 回归\"]\n    T3 --&gt; T4[\"修复阻塞 Bug\"]\n    T4 --&gt; T5[\"TestFlight RC\"]\n    T5 --&gt; T6[\"App Store 提交\"]\n    T6 --&gt; T7[\"审核等待(1-3天)\"]\n    T7 --&gt; T8[\"发布上线\"]\n\n    classDef dev fill:none,stroke:#2196F3\n    classDef qa fill:none,stroke:#FF9800\n    classDef release fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50\n\n    class T1,T2 dev\n    class T3,T4,T5 qa\n    class T6,T7,T8 release</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 使用 App Store Connect API 可以完全自动化提交流程，包括上传构建包、设置发布日期和提交审核。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>版本策略使用语义化版本（Major.Minor.Patch）+ CI 自增构建号</li>\n<li>CI/CD 流水线覆盖编译、测试、静态分析、分发全流程</li>\n<li>Fastlane 是 iOS 发布自动化的事实标准，支持构建、签名、上传一体化</li>\n<li>TestFlight 分组策略实现内部测试 → QA → Beta → RC 的递进验证</li>\n<li>App Store 提交可通过 Fastlane deliver 和 App Store Connect API 完全自动化</li>\n<li>发布流程应有明确的代码冻结点和 RC 验证环节</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"发布工程","id":"发布工程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"版本策略","id":"版本策略"},{"level":2,"text":"CI/CD 流水线","id":"ci-cd-流水线"},{"level":2,"text":"Fastlane 配置","id":"fastlane-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"GitHub Actions 配置","id":"github-actions-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"TestFlight 分发策略","id":"testflight-分发策略"},{"level":2,"text":"App Store 提交自动化","id":"app-store-提交自动化"},{"level":2,"text":"发布流程时间线","id":"发布流程时间线"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"功能开关","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-architecture/large-scale-practices/feature-flags"},"next":{"title":"可测试架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-architecture/testing-architecture/testable-architecture"}}